* 
* Rap command file
* For barge aft part
*
new/append model 
filename ./src/fbarge_as_box.igs
all mappings
read file
heal model
HEAL:plot grid lines on boundaries (3D) toggle 1
set view:0 -0.0330086 0.0165043 0 1.82379 0.766044 0.413176 0.492404 0.642788 -0.492404 -0.586824 -7.13638e-17 0.766044 -0.642788
#pause
close
*
* Build the connectivity and a global triangulation
*
topology
merge tolerance 0.005
split tolerance factor 2
deltaS 0.002
maximum area 0.0001
build edge curves 
merge edge curves    
* the connectivity is determined
#pause
*
* triangulate
*
triangulate
* global triangulation
#pause
exit
*
* Save the  hull
*
save model
fbarge_rapped.hdf
* model has been saved
exit
